Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次要结婚的孩子是老幺啊? 不是老大?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是老幺吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:48.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 好久不见{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到新郎了吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长的帅吗 天啊 真好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:02.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 好久不见 嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 等一下{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么这么晚来?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 花束花束 喂 这样不行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.99,0:01:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小元啊 唉哟 什么事不行 喔 您来啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这不是小元吗 小元  - 要打招呼才行啊 小元 打招呼{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 什么时候长这么大了? 几岁啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小元几岁?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五岁?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.68,0:01:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 不管怎样 侄媳妇你都很辛苦 连长媳该做的事都要做呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没有啦 母亲在那一边  - 嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 喔 嫂子 恭喜啊  - 哎呀 欢迎光临 很荣幸啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 唉哟 嫂子恭喜  - 嗯 谢谢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我收到请帖了 在大儿子之前先结婚了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.95,0:02:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样就好了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过嫂子啊 有点遗憾吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,顺序前后颠倒了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.41,0:02:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老二也都做了啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在还有谁会计较这些呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 嫂子啊 话不是这样说的啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.29,0:02:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个 那个 那嫂子 我们先离开了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您来了啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 教授 什么时候才结婚啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那个...我等等再去看您  - 嗯 好 辛苦了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 辛苦啦 小子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪有什么辛苦的 是我要结婚吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎镇哥认识吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 当然{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 你知道等等三点的事吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好好做啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伯母 您好吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.37,0:02:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎镇你来啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.37,0:02:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恭喜您 伯母{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉 难过死了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉 还有没有好的女人啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈哈 伯母 别这样 今天俊永相亲呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:54.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 真的?  - 对啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对象是谁呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我女朋友的朋友{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人很不错{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:02:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 这次顺利的话可要好好抓住机会啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就麻烦你了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 伯母 请别担心  - 好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孩子啊 怎么没看见你哥哥?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 是吗  - 嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 刚才还在的啊  - 是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要我去找找看吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能走了吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥连我结婚时都没照 不是吗 算了啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 来 要照了喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个最后面戴眼镜的那位 请稍微往旁边移一点{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再一点点 很好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 请看前面喔 好 1 2{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《周末同床》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下午3点 大学路肯德基前{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿着报纸站在那里{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是为了与叫姜妍熙的女人见面所做的记号{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎光临{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,祝您用餐愉快{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要点餐吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这附近还有其他的肯德基吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有耶{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 笑什么?  - 没多久前也有人问了同样的问题{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多也不是少也不是{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要像我一样漂亮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好意思{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能借个火吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您是奎镇的朋友吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,姜妍熙小姐?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 等很久了吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想说再多等一分钟就要走了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 睡过头了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为迟到所以我请你喝咖啡吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:05:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,相亲{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的不会再等下去 打算就那样走了吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以为被骗了啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事实上是有个傢伙和我一样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿着报纸站在那等人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看他和我一起站了一下 感觉有点傻{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以就想走了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你和奎镇是大学同学吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从国中开始就是同学了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听宥莉说了很多你的事{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她非常的自豪呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说了什么呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说你不但是美女而且很善良{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:06:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有对的也有错的呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 不会啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:03.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟想像中的样子相比 确实是美人呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是实话啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,后面的才是错的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在做什么工作呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么都没有听宥莉说呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,职业 年纪 毕业学校之类的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些东西重要吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有时候会想 从不好吃的小菜开始吃 不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重要的事情 重要的时候才会问啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 是这样啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在大学当讲师{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,教什么呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,英文{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么 生活怎么过呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为还只是代课的 大概只能勉强维持生活吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兄弟姐妹们呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一男一女中 我是长子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结婚的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.27,0:08:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果顺利的话 搞不好能有个性感女友的期待感{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,提前破灭了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她像相亲过37或{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,38次的女人那样难搞{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说到相亲 我在30岁以后虽然有很多经验{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会做什么菜呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,豆牙菜拌饭{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,豆牙菜拌饭?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比看起来的样子还更平凡呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让人打哈欠的官腔对话接连不断{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她经常对我露出的微笑{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是像在拍证件照一样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以完全没办法猜测{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.11,0:08:57.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是不是对我有好感{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎样呢?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该怎么说{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有点无聊 故事太简单了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然简单 但是也满有趣的呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:21.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是 简单的东西却很有趣 是好莱坞电影的优点吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我肚子很饿 去哪里吃个晚餐吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是电影的错 是因为我{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还陷在剧情太过简单的相亲里{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要喝一杯吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:43.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不了 我不太会喝酒{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一杯啤酒没关系吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那就一杯好了  - 好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 可以了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:09:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干杯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很会喝啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天酒特别甜{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,公车等好久怎么都还没来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.81,0:10:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茶味道怎么样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和这边伽?琴的声音很配{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请再拿一点松针酒来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.07,0:11:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还好吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.07,0:11:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我来吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事实上{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那电影我已经看过了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,前天也去相亲了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当时非常无聊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又去看了那无聊的电影{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可笑吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个月内已经和十个以上的男人见过面了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样下去的话一定能结婚的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好笑吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.89,0:12:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个 可以再多给一个杯子吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喝得很高兴{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,电车下班了吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.49,0:12:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,深夜公车应该也没了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么办?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只能祈祷记忆不要被切断了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要去哪呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得叫计程车了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.43,0:12:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还能走吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了? 要送我回家吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:12:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比起去再回来的计程车钱{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,似乎旅馆的费用更便宜一点{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正好像也醉了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,计程车钱也好 旅馆费也好 好像都一样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别脱了 快进来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:40.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全都别脱了 快点进来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放入{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还没湿不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那样才好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要射在里面{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那男的长的不好看吧?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那男人啊 拿报纸那个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 拿着报纸的人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:15:59.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像是美男子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.91,0:16:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗? 怎么会{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 认识的人吗  - 昨晚通信认识的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一直吵着说要见面{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以想和两人中 看起来比较好的人见面{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的很帅吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很可惜吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和他能见面的话会更好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自称是帅哥呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还说是工程师{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有一间店{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且还有点纯真{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己没办法愉快的和别人通信{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的能找到对象吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 为什么迟到了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,错过公车了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:17:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要搭那班公车才行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,透过聊天来找对象 不是疯子吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要做啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:12.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是这样的话 托你的福 我现在应该{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要和在汉堡店打工的女学生玩的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打工的女学生?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:22.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:25.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 漂亮吗?  - 当然{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.83,0:17:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把头发绑在后面 戴着帽子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,的确是比你漂亮呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说万一{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你和那傢伙见面{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.69,0:17:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我和那个打工的女学生见面的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.15,0:17:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在我们会怎样呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,睡了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:17:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在隔壁的房间吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是睡了比较好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是要问那个打工的女学生{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我照着预定行程去相亲的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在会是怎么样呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这诗的主角普鲁佛洛克{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自我意识很强是冷漠的人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要闭上眼睛 试试看成为普鲁佛洛克吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎呀 这对各位有什么价值?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是真正好的诗呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是从这种属于个人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,琐碎的杂念与迷失为起点{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,教授{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.29,0:18:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会好好品尝的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.71,0:19:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个啊 是这样的 刚刚您说的那个录影带啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,录影带?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是刚刚教授在上艾略特之前不是说了关于电影的事吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 安魂曲?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 就是那个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 那个能借我看吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个CD我也还没看过{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也没有韩文字幕{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那样也没关系{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你想看的话 当然就借你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么不如教授您看的时候 我也和您一起看可以吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.24,0:19:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就说定了喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了 教授不记得我的名字吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:35.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫做流世银{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,约会{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 笑什么? 你这小子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人生的第一次 爱情的火花{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.35,0:19:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,王琳 不管什么时候看都会烦吧?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:19:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 我觉得你更烦耶 小子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在只剩下你一个了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.53,0:20:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在担心什么 我一个人过得更好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管怎样 宥莉恭喜你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己一个人不是更好吗 喂 你这小子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么你妈妈只要看到我就问{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉呀 奎镇啊 哪里有好的女孩子呀? 每次都这样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 放过我吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你已经晚到了还说这种话?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了 怎么样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:25.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妍熙啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.43,0:20:29.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 对啊 怎样了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 介绍给你就不错了 可不是说讨厌就行的 你这小子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.07,0:20:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 喂?  - 俊永先生?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我 妍熙{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 妍熙小姐{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妍熙小姐? 还好吗?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 那天 怎...怎么平安回去的?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过这么久才问{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么这段时间都没跟我联络?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.43,0:21:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在正想要和你连络啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我应该再多等一下的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我明天有空 我们要见面吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.15,0:21:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要做什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,骑脚踏车之类的 怎样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.57,0:22:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想起拿着报纸见面的事情{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.25,0:23:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别脱了 就这样做{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.63,0:23:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么一射精就想要跑去浴室?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.01,0:23:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,精液黏在身上的话会很不舒服{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道那样很破坏气氛吗?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.07,0:23:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做的时候为什么不把衣服全脱了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.69,0:23:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那样的话无法兴奋起来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.78,0:23:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.99,0:23:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看见脱光了人的身体{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感觉像瘦肉的话会想吐{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.92,0:23:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是如果有穿着衣服{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.46,0:23:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就会觉得那是个人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.05,0:23:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且还会有他独有的气习{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.97,0:23:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从衣服上?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.30,0:23:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.80,0:23:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这什么话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.35,0:24:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难不成以前喜欢过的男人和我穿的衣服一样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那天不是错过了公车吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.98,0:24:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.40,0:24:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那天你应该在约定的时间就到了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.66,0:24:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是因为两个人都在等{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.91,0:24:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以躲起来在旁边看{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.08,0:24:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过比起另外那个傢伙 我应该是比较好看{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以等到那个傢伙走了之后你才出现在我面前 对吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.63,0:24:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,随你怎么想{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.05,0:24:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我也有那种选择权的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.43,0:24:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我应该会去跟那打工的女学生见面{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.68,0:24:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.27,0:24:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.69,0:24:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样弄的话 我看起来应该也很年轻吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.07,0:24:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,背影很像{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.61,0:24:58.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么从现在开始 你就把我当成是那打工的女学生{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.99,0:25:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没办法  - 为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.24,0:25:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她的脸长得很善良{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.87,0:25:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉 你真是{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.17,0:25:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.21,0:25:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去哪里?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.17,0:25:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要继续一直待在这儿吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.93,0:25:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.80,0:25:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就从现在开始我们对彼此要有礼貌{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.02,0:25:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有去高级的餐厅吃晚餐{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.94,0:25:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,分开的时候也要买玫瑰跟熊玩偶才行 知道吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.02,0:25:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.61,0:25:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,善良的男人都会这么做{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.40,0:25:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那先去百货公司吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.66,0:25:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的会买给我吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.66,0:25:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天是我侄子的生日 得要去买礼物才行啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 要去哪?  - 怎么了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.29,0:25:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这边是责厨房用品的地方啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.17,0:25:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.46,0:25:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过既然来了就晃一圈看看吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说的也是{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.30,0:26:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是水晶耶{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.10,0:26:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个放进烤箱里也没关系吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.02,0:26:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个放在餐桌上的话会很棒 对吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.28,0:26:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别看了啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.53,0:26:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来看一下{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.58,0:26:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亲爱的 这个怎样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.59,0:26:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很适合呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.93,0:26:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 不要啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.68,0:26:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,试一下看看嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.56,0:26:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们煮饭的时候穿这围裙一定会很好看吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.77,0:26:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您先生看起来很体贴呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.23,0:26:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.86,0:26:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是最近新婚夫妇们最喜欢的东西{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.53,0:26:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很合适吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:26:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.07,0:27:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们看起来真的很像新婚夫妇 对吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.99,0:27:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,演技很好呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.37,0:27:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当演员都没问题{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.25,0:27:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 有趣嘛  - 是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.58,0:27:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么就这样一辈子如何?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.09,0:27:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一辈子?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在 是在求婚吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.13,0:27:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.72,0:27:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不然?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.84,0:27:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这话也是演技啊 我们是假结婚啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.43,0:27:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我妈希望今年结束前我能结婚{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.85,0:27:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不像话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.60,0:27:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想想其实满简单的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.44,0:27:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各自过自己的生活{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.73,0:27:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过节的时候就假装是夫妻{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.90,0:27:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对于不结婚的人来说节日更是让人难受{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.11,0:27:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那样行吗? 会被发现的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.82,0:27:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,周末像夫妻那样一起过就行了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.49,0:27:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后岳父母来的话呢 嗯 只要说这种话给他们听就行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.12,0:27:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难过的快要死了 妈妈{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.38,0:27:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个人一点家事都不做{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.21,0:27:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连粗活都是我在做呢 妈{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们假装生活在一起的事实在无法想像{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.34,0:28:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那对朋友们呢?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.43,0:28:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那也很简单{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.14,0:28:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别人在炫耀自己老公时 你也那样做{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,装模作样地说一些不满就行了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.14,0:28:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们夫妻呢 没那心思互相帮对方找袜子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.81,0:28:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他早上上班的时候 没心情找袜子穿{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.57,0:28:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚上我懒得找他脱下的袜子来洗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.45,0:28:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 其实没什么难的嘛  - 对啊 很简单嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.62,0:28:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那 性呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.49,0:28:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那个当然要真的做啦  - 唉哟 你这坏蛋{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.63,0:28:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 看结婚的朋友们买的东西 都很相似呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.92,0:28:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,担心的也都差不多 也都差不多幸福{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.30,0:28:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像是在开什么连锁店一样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.01,0:28:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 现在我们要去哪里啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.06,0:28:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 得要买你侄子的礼物才行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.14,0:28:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:28:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好喜欢这夜景{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.15,0:29:00.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.69,0:29:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过在这种地方看夜景的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.95,0:29:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,经常会有这种想法{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.33,0:29:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上帝是不是总在这么高的地方休息{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.04,0:29:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里看起来世界是很美好的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.14,0:29:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过在这瞬间这位上帝也暂时{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.27,0:29:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,睁一只眼闭一只眼{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要说为什么的话 那是因为有很漂亮的美女在身边啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.66,0:29:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无聊吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.75,0:29:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算是谎话也不错{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.50,0:30:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一辈子都这样约会{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.05,0:30:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尽情地听这种甜言密语过活的话就太棒了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.30,0:30:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我侄子那小子真的会喜欢这乌龟吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.60,0:30:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很可爱不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.27,0:30:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五只都要取名字喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.61,0:30:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好像要去相亲 下星期{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.78,0:30:31.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有听到我的话吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.49,0:30:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.33,0:30:36.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是去呢 还是不去?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.33,0:30:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看着办吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.67,0:30:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那样的话我也会说{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.30,0:30:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是就算我说不要去 你也不一定会听我的 不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.09,0:30:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那倒是{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.64,0:30:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过如果你说不要去的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.35,0:30:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至少我会假装不去啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.06,0:31:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的有想要结婚的想法吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.06,0:31:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然啊 有适合的男人的话 马上就会结了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.98,0:31:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗 你说结婚?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.36,0:31:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了? 我像没办法结婚的样子吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.87,0:31:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说想结婚{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.99,0:31:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那不是种犯罪行为吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.66,0:31:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好笑{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.84,0:31:25.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是在说处女之类的问题{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.42,0:31:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而是像你这种类型的人结婚的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.17,0:31:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有办法一辈子只想着新郎一个人吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.05,0:31:32.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你认为有可能?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有自信{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绝对不会被发现的自信{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.62,0:32:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这似乎也是某种解答{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.04,0:32:07.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无论你或我 在懂事以后都是不停地喜欢上别人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.30,0:32:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且也谈恋爱{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.97,0:32:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是那种不停转变的感情{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.76,0:32:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那样的感觉 和别人结婚后就会消失吗 这是很可笑的话吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.18,0:32:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的是那样吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.81,0:32:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且你在找的并不是某种男人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.49,0:32:31.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.69,0:32:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而是在找某种条件吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.28,0:32:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是在找某种男人而是找某种条件 我说错了吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.70,0:32:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要假装很了不起 你又知道什么了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.62,0:32:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你阻止我的话 我就不会去相亲了啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.09,0:32:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我不符合你要的条件{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.92,0:32:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为和我没有结婚的可能性 所以那天才和我睡的不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.72,0:32:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是单纯地喜欢所以才睡吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.05,0:33:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是想知道俊永先生的想法而已{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.56,0:33:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当初是没有要相亲打算的 你知道吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.96,0:33:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结婚典礼{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.88,0:33:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.93,0:33:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我啊 世银 流世银{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.97,0:33:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 是喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.14,0:33:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前的约定还记得吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.31,0:33:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.14,0:33:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在有带着那CD吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.85,0:33:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是有带着 你现在在哪?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.56,0:33:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请等一下 现在正要过去教授您那边{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.11,0:33:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您好 教授{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.61,0:34:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 你好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.87,0:34:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,电影有趣吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.13,0:34:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 不 其实有点腻{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.05,0:34:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是因为和教授一起看所以觉得有趣{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.09,0:34:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,教授是用什么香水呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.64,0:34:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,味道很好闻呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.18,0:34:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.52,0:34:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要把剩下的带回去看 以后再还我吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.65,0:34:39.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 就这样吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.37,0:34:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个 教授{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.33,0:34:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从上教授的课开始 就有想要和教授接吻的想法{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.59,0:35:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.39,0:35:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上课的样子真的非常的可爱啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.69,0:35:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.23,0:35:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比起我来说 不是更常看着窗户外面吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.53,0:35:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是这样吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.28,0:35:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有喜欢的人吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.66,0:35:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.29,0:35:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那 会结婚吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.00,0:35:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.57,0:36:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干嘛不坐下?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.58,0:36:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过的好吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.70,0:36:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 好久不见{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.62,0:36:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这明天要结婚的傢伙 在这里干嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.54,0:36:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是这样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.55,0:36:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也有话想和智英说{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.76,0:36:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我先走了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.93,0:36:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 智英啊 喂 智英{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.48,0:36:37.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 我啊 绝对不是只因为智英{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.86,0:36:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,经常会有一结婚 就没办法再这么做的想法{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.78,0:36:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么? 单身生活马上就要终结了所以舍不得吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.62,0:36:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果可以逃走的话就算是逃亡也会想去{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.17,0:37:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果逃走就会伤害到什么的感觉{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个 你这小子 宥莉也一样吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.89,0:37:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道啦 妈的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.01,0:37:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的话呢 明天就不会去典礼会场了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.23,0:37:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新郎 赵奎镇先生{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.48,0:37:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会一辈子爱着新娘宋宥莉吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.52,0:37:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.69,0:37:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我心中是很期待奎镇的结婚典礼{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.11,0:37:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为和妍熙能自然地再见面的缘故{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.12,0:37:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事实上我很后悔那天说了那些和妍熙有关的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.62,0:37:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然我认为妍熙是新娘的朋友所以当然会出席结婚典礼{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.00,0:37:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是却没有看见她的踪影{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.92,0:37:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那个  - 嗯?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.80,0:37:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 7点的飞机对吧?  - 嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,7点的话 就得4点离开才行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.35,0:37:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 从刚才开始怎么了?  - 什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.64,0:37:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要去密月旅行吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.39,0:37:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别再担心了 吃饭吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.35,0:38:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看起来有点晚了 你要喝杯饮料吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.36,0:38:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 算了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.21,0:38:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托饶了我吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.05,0:38:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 抱歉{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.22,0:38:28.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.80,0:38:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打个招呼 这边是我国中时的朋友们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.56,0:38:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你好  - 是 你们好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.18,0:38:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,俊永你见过了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.14,0:38:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 嗯 这位是恩美  - 啊 你好 听过很多您的事呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.77,0:38:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 还有这位是智英  - 你好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.77,0:38:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,密月旅行要去哪呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.86,0:38:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要去峇里岛 搬家请客的时候请务必要来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.65,0:38:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宥莉啊 现在时间有点晚了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.78,0:38:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好久不见{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.07,0:38:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 好久不见{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.08,0:38:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一路顺风{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.41,0:38:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 要打电话喔  - 走啰{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.46,0:39:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去哪里再喝一杯吧 没办法就这样分开吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.24,0:39:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们是从什么时候认识的朋友?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.66,0:39:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 国中的时候开始{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.53,0:39:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会腻吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.24,0:39:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为没办法常常见面啊 没有老公那么腻{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.33,0:39:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的没有老公那么腻?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.17,0:39:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.88,0:39:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.56,0:39:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有一只乌龟不见了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.52,0:40:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管怎么找都找不到{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.73,0:40:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要重新再买一只吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.53,0:40:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是 不见了啊 五只里面的其中一只{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.16,0:40:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五只全都不见的时候{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.54,0:40:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再联络我吧 我买新的给你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.21,0:40:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,选择{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.00,0:41:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过得好吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.92,0:41:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.38,0:41:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每天一边等乌龟死掉一边过日子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.22,0:41:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.22,0:41:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无聊的时候就呆坐在鱼缸前{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.85,0:41:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瞪着乌龟看{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.02,0:41:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样坐着的话 侄子会问{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.23,0:41:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叔叔在做什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.23,0:41:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 在等乌龟什么时候死掉{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.95,0:41:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么事?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.37,0:41:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以为你不会再跟我联络了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.75,0:41:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在附近办点事所以就过来看看{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.17,0:41:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在想电话号码就顺便过来了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.30,0:41:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.30,0:42:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 都找到了吗  - 嗯 等一下{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.14,0:42:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去相亲了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.65,0:42:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗? 是怎样的人?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.19,0:42:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是医生 他说兄弟姐妹也都是医生{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.11,0:42:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终于找到了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.28,0:42:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过长得不怎么好看{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.04,0:42:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多不好看?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.21,0:42:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要做吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.34,0:42:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.84,0:42:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.55,0:42:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也要去跟医生见面才行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.81,0:42:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,医生?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.35,0:42:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找个女医生之类的见面啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.85,0:42:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 好痛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.82,0:42:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我妈 生病了啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.86,0:43:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还好吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.59,0:43:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.89,0:43:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 相簿  - 相簿?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.47,0:43:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 我的成长史不好奇吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.60,0:43:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.57,0:43:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我妈{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.69,0:43:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是个美人呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.70,0:43:43.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,父母之间的关系似乎很好呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.37,0:43:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 她到现在还是只爱着我爸{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.67,0:43:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小时候也很漂亮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.71,0:44:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是谁照的?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.88,0:44:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.72,0:44:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 是喔?  - 嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.97,0:44:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道你还有这方面的才能{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.81,0:44:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没说吗 我小时候的小小梦想{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.14,0:44:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当摄影师啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.48,0:44:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 那个啊 停在这附近就行了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.11,0:44:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你送我来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.62,0:44:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难不成和你相亲的那个男人在这间医院里上班?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.62,0:44:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想太多了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.34,0:44:40.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢啦 再见{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.22,0:44:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.36,0:44:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不要一起上去看看?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.90,0:45:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 妈  - 嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.07,0:45:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我今天带了很棒的礼物来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.70,0:45:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 您好  - 啊 是{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.08,0:45:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟我在一起的女人很多 说我不错的 这是其中的一个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.16,0:45:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这小子 快过来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.37,0:45:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎唷 还带东西来 快坐下吧 这边请{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.63,0:45:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 给我吧  - 嗯 好 好 坐下吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.71,0:45:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎唷 有什么可以给的啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.17,0:45:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 坐着就好了  - 让我来吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.38,0:45:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是说坐着了吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.01,0:45:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 虽然这不太适合招待客人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.06,0:45:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说什么招待呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.97,0:45:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈 这里是医院{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.68,0:45:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才那样嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.98,0:45:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来削吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.19,0:45:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用不用{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.15,0:45:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我来削吧  - 唉哟 没关系啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.90,0:45:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放着我再来削吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.07,0:45:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这女人 这又是从哪学的?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.03,0:45:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种静静地眨着眼睛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.82,0:45:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,将水果皮薄薄地削下来的事{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.74,0:45:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有古时候的媳妇在婆婆面前才会做这种动作啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.42,0:45:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请吃这个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.75,0:46:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过你在这种情况下来见我 我该怎么办才好啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.38,0:46:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请别这么说{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.97,0:46:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请快点痊愈{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.84,0:46:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请别太紧张{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.01,0:46:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从今天开始我每天都会带一个人来 妈你就从那当中挑选吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.98,0:46:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很突然地就见面了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.44,0:46:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,紧紧地抓着我的手问东问西的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.23,0:46:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,突然觉得有点抱歉{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.86,0:46:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有啦 没关系 我只说你是学校的学妹{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.11,0:46:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.16,0:46:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为你那样说 所以她才依依不舍?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.04,0:46:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.17,0:46:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不想做{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.71,0:46:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是你来的目的不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.30,0:46:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是伤脑筋啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.68,0:46:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.93,0:46:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个是医生{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.55,0:46:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两个是公司职员 还有一个是投资企业家{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.23,0:46:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.86,0:47:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在你们五个人之中该选谁啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.40,0:47:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去掉我吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.11,0:47:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想要试试看有个家庭啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.74,0:47:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,首先成为医师娘的话 虽然不用担心生活{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.75,0:47:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但单调的生活里一定得和一堆亲戚们见面吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.88,0:47:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还得要看那张 长得不怎么好看的脸{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.80,0:47:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再来是公司职员的老婆{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.01,0:47:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个呢 虽然能有可爱的老公一起快乐的生活{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.64,0:47:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过钱太少了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.73,0:47:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,身高为什么也那么矮?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.98,0:47:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别那样 好痒{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.03,0:47:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一个也还是公司职员{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.74,0:47:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过因为是一流大学出身{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.49,0:47:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也有自己的房子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.46,0:48:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了 眼睛看起来很和善{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.96,0:48:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过似乎有点恋母情结{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.63,0:48:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每句话都会说我妈妈她怎样 我妈妈她怎样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.60,0:48:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我怎么样呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.68,0:48:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.31,0:48:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你呢 有率直的地方 还挺不错的 妈妈看起来也很不错{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.90,0:48:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.15,0:48:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有? 技巧也不错啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.21,0:48:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过看起来像是得要租房子住{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.84,0:48:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且也很花心的样子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.21,0:48:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很明显结婚后只要有空的话就会出轨{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.60,0:49:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的很复杂{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.39,0:49:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪有什么复杂的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.81,0:49:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是我的条件比较好 把其他穷小子都踢开吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.07,0:49:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.44,0:49:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我绝不会因为经济因素抛弃你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.78,0:49:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么那么有自信?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.33,0:49:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是你的话 应该也不会抛弃我{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.58,0:49:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掉出来了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.21,0:49:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会在两人当中选一个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.76,0:49:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恭喜啊 那就好好抓住我吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.60,0:49:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还没决定啊 要选你还是要选那个医生{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.23,0:49:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和我不行 所以好好抓住那个医生吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.11,0:49:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的没有一点要和我结婚的念头?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.40,0:49:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是 不管是谁都一样啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.03,0:50:02.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.08,0:50:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说说看嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.22,0:50:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没有自信过着欺骗的日子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.89,0:50:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果能去哪个远方旅行就好了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.66,0:50:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,教授 教授{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.46,0:50:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.81,0:51:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新婚旅行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.06,0:51:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 还是不要结婚了吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.23,0:51:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了? 睡过了发现没什么厉害的?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.91,0:51:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在医院做也要收钱?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.79,0:51:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他的左眼下方有个像螳螂的痣{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.34,0:51:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真的很不喜欢那个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.72,0:51:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要笑{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.72,0:51:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绝对会因为看见那个 而每周都吵一次架的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.31,0:51:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只因为那个痣都这样了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.15,0:51:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果整天都只做家事{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.61,0:51:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有公婆的问题{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.78,0:51:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要把这些问题都解决{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.03,0:52:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底要花上几个月?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.57,0:52:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结婚典礼也要办在蔚山{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.12,0:52:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为他的亲戚们都在那边{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.08,0:52:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那像话吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.04,0:52:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这婚姻 我真的要重新再好好想想{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.92,0:52:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用啊 你绝对会结的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.67,0:52:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么说?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.05,0:52:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我弟弟结婚时也这么说{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.42,0:52:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,猜测会怎样? 新娘的妈妈个性怎样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.76,0:52:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我那时候以为他绝对会逃婚 还会影响到两家的关系{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.27,0:52:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真做到这样的话还能结婚吗 我那时候就有这样的想法{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.40,0:52:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像你的话 一定会叫朋友出来然后一整天哭哭啼啼的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.78,0:52:42.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过试着了解之后 才发现那都是结婚必经的过程{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.95,0:52:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真会说{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.25,0:52:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天忙吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.62,0:52:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有想要买什么吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.75,0:52:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要买的东西不是只有一两样啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:53:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 至少也有写个什么清单的吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.63,0:53:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这样一直碎碎念 真的很像新郎耶{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.04,0:53:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很累吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.29,0:53:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都好了吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.50,0:53:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再看看礼服吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.92,0:53:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还没穿好吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.30,0:53:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,穿好了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.93,0:53:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.60,0:53:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很漂亮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.44,0:54:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不知道这是什么新郎 这样面无表情{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.16,0:54:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连家都看好了 那我就先走了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.00,0:54:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不进去吗  - 算了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.46,0:54:25.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我买的房子 你不好奇吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.68,0:54:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进来吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.02,0:54:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.32,0:54:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是真的木头呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.04,0:54:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想喝什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.25,0:54:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都可以{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.42,0:55:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.23,0:55:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样看起来 这男友还真的给了你不少东西嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.28,0:55:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你很了解嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.41,0:55:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.45,0:55:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会买下这间房子是因为你的关系啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.29,0:55:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别说笑了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.25,0:55:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正这也是你的家{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.08,0:55:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是那样还不知道{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.09,0:55:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 你这样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.26,0:55:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说绝对不会结婚也不继续相亲{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.39,0:55:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没办法这么快就抛弃你啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.29,0:56:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是栋美丽阳光会直接照射进来的房子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.63,0:56:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,问着 孩子们还没回来吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.47,0:56:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,似乎会是一个很棒的下午{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.53,0:57:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以后这里有你的味道的话该怎么办?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.54,0:57:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么? 会被发现?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.33,0:57:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 应该会更刺激{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.84,0:57:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和老公做的时候 不要叫我的名字{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.98,0:57:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.23,0:57:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,硬不起来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.78,0:57:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不回去吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.32,0:57:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不喜欢这里{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.33,0:57:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要去哪里?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.96,0:57:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要去哪呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.34,0:57:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,旅行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.09,0:57:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新婚旅行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.97,0:57:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新婚旅行?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.06,0:58:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来这里很棒吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.15,0:58:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.45,0:59:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.04,0:59:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你早就准备好了才来的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.21,0:59:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说过了不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.13,0:59:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以前的梦想是当摄影师{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.17,0:59:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站在那边{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.09,0:59:22.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,算了吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.14,0:59:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 笑一下看看嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.28,1:01:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道这是哪里吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.78,1:01:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.54,1:01:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 你看星星{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.29,1:01:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到市郊你觉得怎样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.63,1:01:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想住民宿{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.63,1:01:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说是新婚旅行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.30,1:01:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是应该睡在旅馆吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.59,1:01:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要 研究生夫妻哪有钱住旅馆?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.18,1:01:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是是新婚第一天{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.06,1:01:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那样也不行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.90,1:01:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把钱省下来 拿那些钱去买岳父母的礼物{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.94,1:01:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是孝顺呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.61,1:01:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请再便宜三千块吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.16,1:01:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经算你便宜很多了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.95,1:01:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 老婆婆 再便宜个三千元嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.91,1:01:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.33,1:01:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.71,1:02:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎样啊 我杀价的手腕{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.18,1:02:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在这样要回市区吗?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.52,1:02:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么差嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.82,1:02:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的没差吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.19,1:02:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.91,1:02:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站那边试试看{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.66,1:02:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别照了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.33,1:02:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站着嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.41,1:02:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最后一张喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.67,1:02:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.09,1:02:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以后你成了教授的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.34,1:02:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会一边看今天的照片一边笑吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.39,1:02:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先从打扫开始吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.06,1:03:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去借扫把来扫地 我用抹布擦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.73,1:03:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有照之前说的 你在门外守着我洗澡{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.15,1:03:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去厕所的时候{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.57,1:03:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你得要跟在后面来才行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.04,1:03:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很有趣 对吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.55,1:03:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老鼠{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.84,1:03:28.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喵{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.43,1:03:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,关灯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.85,1:03:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.19,1:03:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个 厕所从这边转过去就有了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.74,1:03:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想说等等你们可能会问我 所以先告诉你们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.82,1:03:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.83,1:03:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,脱了吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.05,1:04:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就那样射在里面{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.31,1:04:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.18,1:05:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.93,1:05:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两个人都得要工作不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.74,1:05:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好温暖{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.57,1:05:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过你都没说过 你跟以前恋人的事情{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.83,1:05:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么突然问这个?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.87,1:05:24.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为是新婚之夜嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.96,1:05:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每次在换女朋友的时候{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.59,1:05:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说已经分手了的女人的事情 似乎有点差劲{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.89,1:05:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,花花公子的回答{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.01,1:05:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第一个女人 嗯 是像我这样吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.56,1:05:52.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第二个女人 我的加倍佳棒棒糖{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.07,1:05:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 然后第三个女人  - 我是第几个?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.53,1:06:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.45,1:06:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目前为止 跟你睡过的我是第几个男人?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.21,1:06:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这什么话 你是我第一个男人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.54,1:06:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不相信?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.80,1:06:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,相信{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.30,1:06:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.22,1:06:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新婚之夜嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.90,1:07:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,周末夫妇{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.78,1:07:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次大家所读的诗"跳蚤"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.32,1:07:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是以奇想的特殊构思以及夸张的比喻写成的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.79,1:07:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一开始也说过了 这是17世纪{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.75,1:07:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,形而上学诗的特徵{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.67,1:07:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几星期过去了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.38,1:07:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我像是习惯了 等着失联的妍熙的电话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.43,1:07:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 嗯 不是啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.51,1:07:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想念妍熙的时候{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.14,1:07:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,常常会想像她的新婚生活{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.43,1:07:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妍熙她也许{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.15,1:07:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开心地扮演着妻子的角色吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.48,1:07:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在老公下班时间煮好豆酱锅{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.86,1:08:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了维持她所希望的身材{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.95,1:08:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,适当的做运动{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.45,1:08:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后周末的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.62,1:08:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就挽着先生的手去逛街{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.17,1:08:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样想像的话就可以暂时地忘记她{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.72,1:08:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在妍熙结婚两个月后的某天{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.30,1:08:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,突然地 有了想要打电话给她的念头{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.30,1:09:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看起来像结婚了吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.38,1:09:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.09,1:09:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过得怎样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.51,1:09:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很忙{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.18,1:09:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接了翻译的工作{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.97,1:09:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在还跟父母住在一起吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.02,1:09:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们常常叫我快点结婚{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.73,1:09:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以想要自己搬出来住{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.02,1:09:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是却没办法如意{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.73,1:09:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为钱吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.94,1:09:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,差不多吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.45,1:09:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是那样的话 我可以帮你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.95,1:09:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有剩一些退休金{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.54,1:09:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新的职场你还满意吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.75,1:09:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不错啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.13,1:09:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就知道会适合你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.97,1:09:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 没薪水的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.52,1:09:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一天的生活怎么安排?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.23,1:09:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早上做菜{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.10,1:09:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后去游泳池{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.98,1:09:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下午购物{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.40,1:10:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚餐做好了 老公就回来了? 是这样吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.28,1:10:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,差不多{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.65,1:10:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿手的菜是什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.07,1:10:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几乎全部都拿手{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.29,1:10:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得其中辣汤和炖鱼{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.08,1:10:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做得最好吃{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.12,1:10:20.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后两个人一边吃饭一边聊天{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.88,1:10:23.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你嫉妒吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.38,1:10:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想到要再跟我联络啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.51,1:10:31.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 游泳老师都没有长得帅的吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.48,1:10:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我结婚的那天完全没想到你会来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.86,1:10:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你都不知道我有多惊讶{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.32,1:10:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当新娘有点可惜{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.78,1:10:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.82,1:10:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 慢走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.70,1:10:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那个 好好考虑看看吧  - 什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.75,1:10:58.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己搬出来住的事啊 我真的很想帮你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.46,1:11:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然很感谢你 不过还是算了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.84,1:11:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是给你啊 是借你 我走啰{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.47,1:11:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,俊永先生 绝对要好好考虑啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.81,1:11:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道吧? 再见{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.72,1:11:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都还不错{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.10,1:11:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是有点小{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.73,1:11:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.77,1:12:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是说和我两个人住的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.61,1:12:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要再加水吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.82,1:12:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真好喝{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.91,1:12:15.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和我结婚的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.58,1:12:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一起出去回来的话 你会像这样泡咖啡给我喝吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.21,1:12:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是讨厌做那种事 所以才不想结婚的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.42,1:12:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.30,1:12:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用洗碗啊 泡咖啡之类的事来计较爱不爱对方{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.84,1:12:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说得真好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.26,1:12:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新婚旅行时拍的照片 可以放那边{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.69,1:12:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这边可以放餐桌{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.73,1:12:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再放一个花瓶的话一定很棒{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.90,1:12:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以一边做晚餐{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.23,1:12:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一边看你回来了没{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.07,1:12:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真幼稚{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.12,1:12:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结婚之后这样子生活是我小时候的梦想{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.66,1:13:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幼稚也没关系{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.83,1:13:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我们结婚的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.92,1:13:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该会在这样的房子里过新婚生活吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.92,1:13:12.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幸好没跟我结婚对吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.89,1:13:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.85,1:13:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如我们结婚的话可能很快就会分手吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.81,1:13:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打一副钥匙给我吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.82,1:13:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 为什么想再跟我见面?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.74,1:13:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为来这边 感觉心情真的很好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.92,1:13:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样不行 两个人用的话太大了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.51,1:13:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个刚刚好 颜色也不错{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.18,1:13:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 老板 这个多少钱?  - 15万元{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.60,1:14:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,15万元吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.23,1:14:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个也太挤了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.69,1:14:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不如用挂的 看起来像在飞一样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.52,1:14:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在床旁边放这个怎么样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.02,1:14:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比起那个 这个好一点 上面还可以放电视{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.23,1:14:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才您说这个多少钱?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.90,1:14:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,顶多只能14万元给你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.99,1:14:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚刚看了一下 有点瑕疵耶{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.85,1:14:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这些是什么啊  - 怎么了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.89,1:14:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能吃的东西一样也没有嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.64,1:14:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下嘛 回家后我煮好吃的豆酱锅给你吃{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.94,1:14:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们各付一半喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.40,1:14:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全都你付{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.78,1:14:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪有这种事?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.32,1:15:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么没有? 说实话这里哪有我要的东西?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.71,1:15:09.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看 这个{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.67,1:15:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.34,1:15:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 没那种事吧 我一向都放在那的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.43,1:15:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 和朋友见面 所以应该会晚一点回去{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.69,1:15:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天值夜班吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.53,1:15:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那回家见啰 嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.20,1:15:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在看起来 真的像新婚的家了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.33,1:15:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,托你的福 房间变得更挤了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.29,1:15:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不像新婚生活 比较像扮家家酒呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.75,1:15:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么坐在那边啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.71,1:15:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是脚踏垫 不是坐垫啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.88,1:16:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新的哪有关系{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.31,1:16:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要像原始人一样啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.85,1:16:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正那不是我喜欢的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.81,1:16:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但还是不错吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.48,1:16:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,肚子饿死了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.82,1:16:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下 我马上做饭给你吃{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.37,1:16:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎样? 像不像可爱的新娘?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.00,1:16:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,肚子饿了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.72,1:16:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请结帐{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.09,1:16:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 上次你在找波菜对吧  - 是的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.01,1:16:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天有新鲜的喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.97,1:16:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天不用了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.77,1:16:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 新娘都做些什么呢  - 嗯?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.60,1:16:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你似乎都隔一阵子才出现但每天都能看到新郎呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.11,1:16:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在别的地方上班啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.94,1:17:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 你们是周末才见面的夫妻啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.78,1:17:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.49,1:17:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请给我一包香烟{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.24,1:17:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 新郎来了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.62,1:17:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来啦 等等做好吃的炖鱼给你吃{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.59,1:17:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是周末夫妻呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.74,1:17:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要这样洗衣服吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.58,1:17:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有趣嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.75,1:17:53.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,平常就想这样做了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.05,1:18:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈呀{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.91,1:18:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 我在弄火锅{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.96,1:18:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 大概洗一下就好了  - 都洗好了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.00,1:18:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刷了牙再来啦 嘴巴里都是白带鱼的味道{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.47,1:18:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在你刷牙之前 绝对不行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.60,1:18:56.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样结婚的话 魅力很快就会消失 喔 味道好臭{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.99,1:19:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 亲爱的你在吗  - 嗯?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.79,1:19:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出来的时候顺便把刮胡刀 还有刮胡泡一起带出来吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.46,1:19:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.59,1:19:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想帮你刮胡子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.88,1:19:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刮胡子?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.01,1:19:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接吻的时候会刺刺的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.84,1:19:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 轻一点别刮到我  - 嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.53,1:19:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也会这样对老公吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.46,1:20:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做得不错嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.21,1:20:07.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小时候爸爸在刮胡子的时候{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.71,1:20:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都很近的观察{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.80,1:20:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那之后经常会想像帮心爱的男人刮胡子的样子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.43,1:20:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要这样 会痒 想受伤的话就继续这样吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.40,1:20:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 想受伤啊  - 不要弄啦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.75,1:20:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 在外面啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.76,1:20:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上就会回去了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.72,1:20:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吃饭了吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.10,1:20:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那会晚一点呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.33,1:21:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出来啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.84,1:21:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 要走了?  - 嗯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.82,1:21:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么随便开别人的信?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.24,1:21:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看起来像是女生?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.82,1:21:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,教授 我是世银 我有两张音乐会的票{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.20,1:22:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以就想到教授了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.33,1:22:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前一起看的电影{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.16,1:22:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然没有很好看{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.08,1:22:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过那时候教授的表情跟香水味{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.59,1:22:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在还记得很清楚呢 请一定要跟我联络{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.93,1:22:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你跟学生在谈恋爱?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.97,1:22:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么谈恋爱{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.39,1:22:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是认识的学生而已{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.10,1:22:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 不像是普通的关系啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.27,1:22:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都说不是了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.56,1:22:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从什么时候开始见面的?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.48,1:22:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,睡过了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.19,1:22:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想知道什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.57,1:22:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使睡过了那也跟你没关系不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.61,1:22:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说没关系?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.33,1:22:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错啊 我要跟谁见面那不用你来操心{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.21,1:22:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.25,1:22:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不要跟那丫头睡那也不是我管得到的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.55,1:22:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过至少 不要带回来这里{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.05,1:22:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.89,1:23:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是我布置的房子啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.14,1:23:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不希望有其他女人的味道{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.06,1:23:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总是只有想到自己{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.64,1:23:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.40,1:23:11.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也觉得很讨厌 你身上有其他男人的味道{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.91,1:23:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的心情不好的人应该是我才对{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.58,1:23:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我知道了 和那个学生好好的在一起吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.51,1:23:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一定也会和那孩子说一样的话吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.64,1:23:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不打算结婚{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.31,1:23:46.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不想只被一个女人给绑住{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.10,1:23:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事实上你才是卑鄙地边骗女人边选对象 不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.82,1:24:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你哪一次不是这样一走了之?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.95,1:24:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.16,1:24:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后想起来了才再来找我{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.49,1:24:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跟你不一样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.20,1:24:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你只要走了就没事了 可是我心情会很糟{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.29,1:24:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这边还有你的拖鞋 枕头上还沾有你的头发{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.13,1:24:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,心情有多糟你知道吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.62,1:24:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,崩溃{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.43,1:25:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.48,1:25:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是妈啊 你还没起来吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.19,1:25:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.98,1:25:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不起来吃早餐吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.40,1:25:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我煮了海带汤放在那{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.69,1:25:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我本来就不吃早餐的啊  - 唉 真是的 今天不是你生日吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.24,1:25:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道 晚一点我再回电话给您{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.87,1:25:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 俊永啊 喂{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.63,1:26:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回来啦?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.97,1:26:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.72,1:26:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又是泡面吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.31,1:26:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,心情不好也得要吃饭才行啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.94,1:26:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么快就无聊了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.36,1:26:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以为你不会再来了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.69,1:26:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不想我吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.40,1:26:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一开始就是打算这样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.78,1:26:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才借我钱的吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.28,1:26:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是啊 没办法所以才这样不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.41,1:26:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.09,1:27:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自己做的 看起来很好吃吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.68,1:27:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么这种反应啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.47,1:27:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人家为了烤这个蛋糕 折胜了一整天呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.40,1:27:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,装饰的东西跑去哪了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.15,1:27:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明明就摆上去了啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.26,1:27:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要接{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.76,1:27:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该是那个人啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.43,1:27:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前也有一次没接 他就缠着我问东问西的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.44,1:28:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂? 喔 刚下课{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.57,1:28:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正要和别人一起去吃饭{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.49,1:28:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗 但我好像没办法马上回去{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.16,1:28:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前说我也要去买的 怎么丢下我先去了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.71,1:28:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 一两个小时?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.01,1:28:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚上一定会回去吃 晚点见啰{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.89,1:28:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在上什么课?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.48,1:28:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太无聊了 所以下午开始上英文会话课{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.74,1:28:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绝对没问题的 因为我是英文老师{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.53,1:28:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恭喜 干杯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.21,1:29:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要照才行吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.63,1:29:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然 一定要照起来才行{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.59,1:29:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过除了我以外 没有别人帮你庆祝生日吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.64,1:29:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 吃看看{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.60,1:29:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该跟买的味道不一样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.23,1:29:26.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好吃呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.23,1:29:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.15,1:29:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你应该是喜欢蛋糕才做的吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.61,1:29:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.11,1:29:37.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 是满喜欢的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.49,1:29:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那还喜欢什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.46,1:29:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也喜欢烤肉啊 辣汤啊 那是我做的所以全吃下去吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.80,1:29:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然啦 你的手艺那么好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.64,1:29:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过为什么突然问这些事?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.14,1:30:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完全不像是我的新郎会说的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.39,1:30:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么 只是好奇{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.39,1:30:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好奇什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.65,1:30:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就好奇啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.94,1:30:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那说说看吧 好奇的事情{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.19,1:30:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老公和我{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.99,1:30:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 还是算了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.70,1:30:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么? 说说看嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.87,1:30:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么特别的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.83,1:30:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是觉得像在孤岛上一样{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.13,1:30:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是那样的话就好了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.76,1:30:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是得要走了吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.22,1:30:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有时间嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.89,1:30:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 别喝了  - 为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.85,1:30:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带着酒味回家的话 老公不会觉得奇怪吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.94,1:30:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就睡醒再走啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.38,1:31:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 让我去你那睡几天吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.01,1:31:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 怎么了?  - 从今天开始分居了啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.59,1:31:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,分居? 你这小子居然分居了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.27,1:31:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.44,1:31:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也没什么{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.44,1:31:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我前天才知道的 我老婆早就什么都知道了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.28,1:31:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,智英的事情啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.66,1:31:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,似乎睁一只眼闭一只眼很久了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.41,1:31:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,智英也知道吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.24,1:31:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她说不要再联络了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.29,1:31:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说是同样身为女人会有罪恶感{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.79,1:31:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.42,1:31:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怎样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.42,1:31:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要怎么办?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.26,1:31:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.76,1:32:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,趁这次机会彻底的分手怎样?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.60,1:32:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,分手? 跟谁?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.76,1:32:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我等多久了吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.51,1:32:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么把手机关机了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.97,1:32:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我今天跟奎镇见面了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.60,1:32:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎镇他怎么了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.19,1:32:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我今天早上也跟宥莉通了电话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.49,1:33:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是结婚典礼的时候 穿黑色套装的那个女人吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.54,1:33:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么爱她的话 现在就应该要跟宥莉离婚不是吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.50,1:33:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪有那么简单{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.84,1:33:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,离婚的话也没办法马上找到住的地方{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.05,1:33:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以为只有宥莉难过吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.84,1:33:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连这点小事都怕的话又怎么爱别人?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.51,1:33:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你做得到吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.39,1:33:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我做得到{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.44,1:33:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 你做不到{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.69,1:33:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.70,1:33:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有不被发现的自信{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.46,1:33:53.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以后别来了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.29,1:33:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.54,1:33:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样比较好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.38,1:34:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不觉得{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.51,1:34:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,照片拍得很好呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.26,1:34:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 你也很会拍照呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.81,1:34:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这张真的拍得很棒{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.98,1:34:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甜密的新婚取这名字寄到女性杂志吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.74,1:34:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不怕吗 这样会留下资料喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.08,1:34:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真的搞不懂你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.04,1:34:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做这些事情是为了什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.08,1:34:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以后你结婚的话 就可以做为纪念啦 怎么了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.43,1:34:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亲爱的 你知道我现在在做什么吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.48,1:35:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.32,1:35:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,豆牙菜汤 凉伴豆牙菜{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.11,1:35:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.45,1:35:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,豆牙菜拌饭{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.37,1:35:12.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我煮泡面来吃就好了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.83,1:35:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不喜欢豆牙菜拌饭?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.58,1:35:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很特别耶{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.12,1:35:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对你来说很特别 对我来说没什么啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.29,1:35:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,煮个泡面给我吃就好了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.21,1:35:23.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在是食物斗争吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.13,1:35:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我这么用心的在做饭耶{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.22,1:35:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不这样也没关系{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.26,1:35:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不想吃的话就别吃了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.93,1:35:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等看你怎么求我{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.60,1:35:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 要去哪?  - 去买泡面{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.48,1:35:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 等等{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.65,1:35:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那顺便买辣椒回来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.44,1:35:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我吃泡面不加辣椒的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.66,1:35:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会买回来吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.20,1:35:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.33,1:36:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚刚新娘也买了泡面和豆牙一起买的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.84,1:36:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 这样吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.18,1:36:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结果还是买了嘛{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.14,1:36:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是有泡面吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.68,1:36:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管怎样都得要有人去买辣椒啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.61,1:36:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的要吃泡面?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.12,1:36:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怪傢伙{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.38,1:36:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快来吃吧 快点{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.56,1:37:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的只吃那个?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.19,1:37:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的只吃那个?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.57,1:37:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的意思是 要我一个人把这些都吃完吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.93,1:38:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们结束吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.26,1:38:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,渐渐开始对对方感到厌倦了吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.98,1:38:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你确定?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.98,1:38:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正 这关系也不知道能持续多久{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.36,1:38:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我并不认为这是因为豆牙菜拌饭的关系{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.45,1:38:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的能结束吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.70,1:38:44.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是意志力的问题{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.91,1:38:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难以忘记你的时候{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.25,1:38:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会试着去找其他女人的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.92,1:38:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.97,1:39:00.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也会那样吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.56,1:39:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也许会因为想你而跑来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.02,1:39:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.78,1:39:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万一我忍不住思念又跑来的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.28,1:39:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要无情地赶我走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.75,1:39:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样比较不会有罪恶感{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.46,1:39:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是觉得比起别人似乎会比较忙一点{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.42,1:39:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管怎样以后别来了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.18,1:39:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你来的话我没有信心能赶你走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.43,1:39:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一想到这是最后 不知怎么地变得很兴奋{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.23,1:39:56.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她的头发 眼眸的转动{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.90,1:40:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皮肤的触感以及体味还有手指的感觉{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.54,1:40:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,将不再属于我的她的全部{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.25,1:40:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一样都没放过 希望能永远地融入我的身体{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.44,1:40:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叔叔你来了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.94,1:40:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 叔叔  - 喔 小元过得好吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.28,1:40:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,弟媳呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.45,1:40:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在美容院{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.78,1:40:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了? 你连通电话都没有就来了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.62,1:40:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,饿了吧 等一下 我马上做饭{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.38,1:40:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在游戏间认识了很多朋友吗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.00,1:40:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每次都是我赢喔{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.46,1:40:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得要好好地跟别人相处才行啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.72,1:41:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只剩下两只了呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.59,1:41:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道 不见了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.68,1:41:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以得要看好才行啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.98,1:41:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 一定要好好吃饭{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.32,1:41:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.40,1:41:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉哟 对了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.44,1:41:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那时候来过病房的那位小姐 最近没和她见面了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.16,1:41:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 她结婚了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.38,1:41:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好几周没跟妍熙联络了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.93,1:41:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这段时间 她好像每隔一周都会来的样子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.01,1:41:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么持续隔周来呢{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.39,1:41:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一开始我觉得这问题很好笑{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.73,1:42:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是 我们一起去过的地方太少了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.36,1:42:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一般的恋人们所经历过的琐碎小事{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.12,1:42:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们也没办法分开带走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.55,1:42:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一开始我会看妍熙留下来的相本{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.14,1:42:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然那段期间她有空就会拍照 然后制作相本{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.93,1:42:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我实在不怎么关心{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.23,1:42:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 那时我觉得那是很危险又很蠢的事{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.03,1:42:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从照片里看来我们两个非常的幸福{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.08,1:42:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是我们并没有继续走那条路{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.25,1:43:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在我好像有一点懂了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.38,1:43:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她为什么要做这种相本{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.59,1:43:11.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有她说没办法结束的话{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.56,1:43:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是什么{\r}
